# Sheep (Ovis aries) 5' RACE technical sequences for cutadapt
# From Park et al. 2023 Mol. Immunol. 156:20-30 (PRJNA900592)
# Protocol: SMARTer 5' RACE, MiSeq 2x300 (600 cycles)
# Used with anchored cutadapt: -g ^SMARTer_anchor -a Sh_IGHG_rev... (or --action=trim)
# Note: These are technical sequences, NOT V-gene primers. Remove with cutadapt, not MaskPrimers.

# SMARTer 5' RACE universal anchor (at 5' end of R1)
# CTAATACGACTCACTATAGGGCAAGCAGTGGTATCAACGCAGAGT
>SMARTer_5prime_Anchor
CTAATACGACTCACTATAGGGCAAGCAGTGGTATCAACGCAGAGT

# C-region reverse primers (at 3' end of R2, gene-specific)
# Sh_IGHG_rev_1 - IgG constant region
>Sh_IGHG_rev_1
TCCCCGCAGCAAGAAGTCAGAGGGTAG

# Sh_IGKC_rev_1 - IgK constant region
>Sh_IGKC_rev_1
GTTTGAAGAGGAAGACGGATGGCTGAGC

# Sh_IGLC_rev_1 - IgL constant region
>Sh_IGLC_rev_1
AGGGTGACCGAGGGTGCGGACTT